# Files excluded from a Vercel CLI deploy upload (`vercel deploy`).
#
# Git-based deploys are unaffected — they only ever see tracked files. This exists
# for the CLI path, which uploads the working directory and therefore picks up
# UNTRACKED local state unless told otherwise.
#
# `.claude/` holds agent worktrees, each with its own node_modules and .next build
# output — ~227 MB at the time of writing, none of it part of the app. It is not in
# .gitignore (agent sessions read it), so without this file a `vercel deploy` from a
# working tree uploads the whole thing.
.claude/
